iv><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629948350439" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629948350439"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1>ダウンシャツ 5つの特徴</h1></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629972413680" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972413680"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629948975060" class="gf_row gf_equal-height" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629948975060" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948358818" data-id="1629948358818" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629948975036" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629948975036"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>ダウンなのにスタイリッシュ</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629948975029" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629948975029"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p>従来のダウンジャケットやインタビューは、<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">モコモコと分厚いため、野暮ったく見えがちでした。新素材「Ethical Down Kapok」で製造されたダウンシャツは、</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">3mmの極薄のため、どんなコーディネイトもスタイリッシュに着こなすことができます。</span></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948367673" data-id="1629948367673" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629948975049" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629948975049" data-resolution="640x640"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/57d08163-2702-43b6-ab62-774adf38da5c/-/format/auto/-/preview/640x640/-/quality/lighter/before-after3.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="640" height="337" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="640" natural-height="337"></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948508331" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948508331" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788047730" data-id="1542788047730" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948508314" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-20" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948508314" data-row-gap="20px" data-extraclass="" style="float: left;"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542787683035" data-id="1542787683035" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629948457477" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629948457477"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>シャツなのにダウンの暖かさ</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1630948508343" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948508343"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>シャツであるにも関わらずダウン形状のため保温性が高く、また、新素材KAPOKは湿気を吸ってみずから発熱し、あなたを暖かく包み込みます。周りが厚着をしている時も、薄着で活動することができます。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788029687" data-id="1542788029687" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948508285" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948508285"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542788052652" data-id="1542788052652"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629948469701" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629948469701" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/49455e98-8fdb-4dd0-8cf5-03942b27862f/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/DSCF6214.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="2048" height="1536" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="2048" natural-height="1536"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1630948977316" class="gf_row gf_equal-height" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948977316" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948358818" data-id="1629948358818" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630948977350" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948977350"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>ダウンなのに厚さ3mmの極薄</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1630948977253" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948977253"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p>従来のダウンジャケットは、厚みがあればあるだけ暖かいとされ、<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">暖かさを求めるとモコモコと分厚いウェアになってしまいます。</span></p><p>カポックは植物由来の素材の発熱作用があるため厚みがなくても<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">ダウンと同等の暖かさが実現。</span></p><p>その結果、3mmの極薄中綿素材のダウンシャツが開発されました。</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948367673" data-id="1629948367673" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630948977403" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630948977403" data-resolution="640x640"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/74e22fa7-b2c1-4bd6-9890-752595c53b06/-/format/auto/-/preview/640x640/-/quality/lighter/iOS%20%E3%81%AE%E7%94%BB%E5%83%8F.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="480" height="640" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="480" natural-height="640"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948757214" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948757214" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788047730" data-id="1542788047730" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948757177" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-20" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948757177" data-row-gap="20px" data-extraclass="" style="float: left;"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542787683035" data-id="1542787683035" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630948757198" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948757198"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>秋冬春に対応する万能シャツ</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1630948757244" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948757244"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>KAPOK KNOTのシャツダウンは、3シーズンも使える万能型。</p><p>春先や秋口は、アウターとしてさっとTシャツの上に羽織って、冬はコートの下にミドルウェアとしてお使いいただけます。</p><p>薄くて暖かいダウンシャツは、コートの中に着ていてもストレスなく、どんな時でもずっと着ていたくなる、これ一枚でいつでもどんな時でも暖かくストレスフリーを実現する製品です。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788029687" data-id="1542788029687" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948757215" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948757215"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542788052652" data-id="1542788052652"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629949135526" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629949135526" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/412d5ea8-fcaa-40e3-ba94-e9375469ca94/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/DSCF6008.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="2048" height="1536" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="2048" natural-height="1536"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629949226094" class="gf_row gf_equal-height" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629949226094" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948358818" data-id="1629948358818" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629949226108" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629949226108"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>雨でも水をはじく</strong></h1><h1><strong>安心の撥水コーティング</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629949226124" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629949226124"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p>KAPOK KNOTのダウンシャツは、アウターとして雨の日でも安心して使っていただけるよう表地に撥水コーティング施しています。</p><p>また、撥水加工は汚れもつきにくいので、ガシガシお使いいただけます。</p><p>※完全防水ではありません。</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948367673" data-id="1629948367673" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629949226136" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629949226136" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/e89a3fa4-ba6d-4173-8523-0154cdd335c0/Videotogif%20_4_.gif" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="540" height="350" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="540" natural-height="350"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948849759" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948849759" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788047730" data-id="1542788047730" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948849825" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-20" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948849825" data-row-gap="20px" data-extraclass="" style="float: left;"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542787683035" data-id="1542787683035" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630948849765" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948849765"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1><strong>カーボンフットプリント8.6kg！</strong></h1><h1><strong>地球に優しくアニマルフリー</strong></h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1630948849748" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630948849748"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>気候変動が危ぶまれる中、KAPOK KNOTでは地球にも優しいプロダクトをお届けします。</p><p>プロダクト製造時に発生するカーボンフットプリント*は8.6kg！植物由来の素材なのでヴィーガンの方も安心です。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629949384294" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629949384294"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>*カーボンフットプリント・・・商品やサービスの原材料の調達から生産、流通を経て最後に廃棄・リサイクルに至るまでのライフサイクル全体を通して排出される温室効果ガスの排出量をCO2に換算したもの。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12" id="c-1542788029687" data-id="1542788029687" style="min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" id="r-1630948849758" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630948849758"><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1542788052652" data-id="1542788052652"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629949251656" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629949251656" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/4df48355-a9bc-46d1-b96e-0ed2aaf5ed52/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%8B%E3%83%9E%E3%83%AB%E3%83%95%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="640" height="318" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="640" natural-height="318"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629961860406" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629961860406"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629948198299" data-id="1629948198299"><div data-label="Liquid" data-key="liquid" id="m-1629961860416" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-liquid" data-ver="1.1" data-id="1629961860416" data-name="Right click on this, and choose Edit Code."><div class="module gf_module- gf_module--lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs {{extraClass}}"><div class="klaviyo-form-TgutaT"></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629950351079" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629950351079"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629950351087" data-id="1629950351087"><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629972385153" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972385153"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629950358880" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629950358880"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1>新素材「Ethical Down Kapok」とは</h1></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629972321903" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972321903"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629950366362" class="gf_row gf_equal-height" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629950366362" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629950366404" data-id="1629950366404" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629950434063" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629950434063" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/cb1779dd-bd47-48f4-8c85-a5a6d7d8633e/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/DSC02934.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="2048" height="1365" natural-width="2048" natural-height="1365"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629950369635" data-id="1629950369635" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629950437189" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629950437189" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7bf86167-77ec-44f2-a2d6-65b0e897c9d3/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E2%91%A1.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="480" height="281" natural-width="480" natural-height="281"></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629950375811" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629950375811"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p>エシカルダウンカポック™️とは、カポックジャパンが開発するカポックコットンをシート状に加工しダウンの代替品として使用できる素材です。</p><p>カポックの吸湿発熱の機能を残し、薄さと軽さを追求した全く新しい素材です。</p><p>軽さの秘密でもある、繊維の空洞。 寒い時には、湿気を吸い、暖かく発熱します。暑い時には、湿気を放出し、涼しく快適にします。カポックの空気の層が、どんな時にも優しくあなたを包み込みます。</p><p>カポックは東南アジアに自生する植物で、コットンの1/8の軽さ、吸湿発熱という、機能性の高い素材です。しかし、その軽さと短さ故に、取り扱いが困難な素材であり、多くの同業者が商品化を諦めてきました。カポックノットは、国内大手繊維メーカーとの研究開発の末、リサイクルポリエステルとの交織によりカポックをシートとして加工することに成功しました。</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629950633612" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629950633612"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629950633586" data-id="1629950633586"><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629972323260" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972323260"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629950643574" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629950643574"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1>様々なシーンで活躍</h1></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629972331436" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972331436"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629950649821" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629950649821" data-layout-lg="4+4+4" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="4+4+4" data-layout-sm="12+12+12" data-layout-xs="12+12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629950649775" data-id="1629950649775"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629950671984" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629950671984" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="el