ey="separator" id="e-1629972284778" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629972284778"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629972303581" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629972303581"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1>試着レビュー</h1></div></div><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" id="e-1629967503426" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629967503426"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1629951023777" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1629951023777" data-layout-lg="4+4+4" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="4+4+4" data-layout-sm="12+12+12" data-layout-xs="12+12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629951023827" data-id="1629951023827"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629951033164" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629951033164" data-resolution="240x240"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/90c40761-a36b-4676-a5c6-ae79a1eb9cf0/-/format/auto/-/preview/240x240/-/quality/lighter/jeremy.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="240" height="240" natural-width="240" natural-height="240"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630030552011" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630030552011"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Jeremyさん</div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629951133048" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629951133048"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">思った以上に薄手ですごく着やすかった上に、アウトドアでもフォーマルでも色んな場面で着れるし、リバーシブルで気分に合わせて色を変えて楽しめるのもいいなと思いました！</span><br></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629951027867" data-id="1629951027867"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630391802947" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630391802947" data-resolution="240x240"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/46350811-73ac-4cd1-96fa-b99f75038146/-/format/auto/-/preview/240x240/-/quality/lighter/%E3%81%99%E3%81%BF%E3%81%8B%E3%81%95%E3%82%93.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="240" height="240" natural-width="240" natural-height="240"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1629977201298" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1629977201298"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">佐藤純華さん</div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1630030599865" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630030599865"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">薄いのにあったかく、ファッション性も高いため荷物がかさばりがちな旅行などに持っていくには最適だなと思いました。羽織として、ボタンを閉めてシャツとして、など何通りもの着方で楽しめるのも魅力だと思います。ちょっとそこまで！の羽織に使うにも軽くて使いやすいのに、オシャレなのも◎です！</span><br></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1630391790827" data-id="1630391790827"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629951090469" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1629951090469" data-resolution="240x240"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/b4a72e9e-f104-472e-be20-43a7d986958b/-/format/auto/-/preview/240x240/-/quality/lighter/iOS%20%E3%81%AE%E7%94%BB%E5%83%8F%20_3_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" width="240" height="240" natural-width="240" natural-height="240"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630391817239" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630391817239"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">白川くるみさん</div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1630391821843" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630391821843"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">今季のデザインは洋服とアウターの間のような感じです。秋や春先にも良いし、真冬はアウターの中に着てもかさむことなく、夏も冷房の効きすぎの室内で羽織ったり年中着られるのはすごくうれしい。ふわっと軽くて薄いので本当に温かいのかな？と思うのですが、段々と体温と共に温かくなっていきます！</span><br></p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1630391908291" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630391908291" data-layout-lg="12" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="12" data-layout-sm="12" data-layout-xs="12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1629951023827" data-id="1629951023827"><div data-label="Image" data-key=